Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add error boundaries and branded 404 page

The app had no error-handling UI: unhandled runtime errors and unknown
routes fell back to Next.js's unstyled defaults. Add:

- not-found.tsx: branded 404 with navigation back to home/marketplace
- error.tsx: route-segment error boundary with retry + digest reference
- global-error.tsx: self-contained root boundary for root-layout failures

